sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer
    participant SPA as React Frontend
    participant Gateway as Caddy Proxy
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Graph as QA LangGraph
    participant Store as Chroma & BM25
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>SPA: Types question ("Where is auth handled?")
    SPA->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/repos/{id}/chat/stream (SSE)
    Gateway->>API: Proxy request (flush_interval -1)
    API->>Graph: Initialize state with question & history
    Graph->>Store: Multi-stage retrieval (BM25 + Chroma RRF)
    Store-->>Graph: Top candidate chunks
    Graph->>LLM: Stream prompt with context & citation instructions
    LLM-->>Graph: Tokens with inline [S#] citations
    Graph-->>API: Yield SSE token events
    API-->>Gateway: SSE stream
    Gateway-->>SPA: SSE stream
    SPA-->>User: Live typed response rendering
    Graph->>Graph: Verify citations & compute confidence
    Graph-->>API: Yield 'citation' & 'confidence' events
    API-->>SPA: Final metadata
    SPA-->>User: Interactive citation highlights & confidence badge
